# ML Kit registers its components by reflection at startup: MlKitInitProvider looks each
# ComponentRegistrar up by the name the merged manifest records, then calls its no-argument
# constructor. Neither is referenced anywhere R8 can see, so without this the registrars are
# stripped, text recognition never registers, and every scan quietly comes back empty.
-keep class * implements com.google.firebase.components.ComponentRegistrar {
    <init>();
}
